note: The licence statement was read at the pinned archive snapshot on 2026-10-28 (page SHA-256 13b6a192c2e3f7d8636170adf4c75bc623537e79ea5524f7b27acaa22c9318a7); the publisher's MASC page states the corpus is under a Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 United States license. The publisher's own page could not be reached from here, so the snapshot is the pinned location.
